# Coverage & Quality Gates

The Enterprise requirement is **100% production coverage**, with every production file accounted for. Define the scope and supported metrics explicitly, collect files even when no test imports them, and make threshold failure block the required status.

> **Confidential — internal use only.** Coverage paths, source excerpts, and reports can reveal implementation details. Retain them in the approved evidence location. Do not include credentials or private download URLs.

## Understand what 100% means

For each supported metric, **covered opportunities must equal total opportunities**. The measured scope must also match all executable production code that should be measured. Passing only changed-file coverage is insufficient for the full production requirement.

A line executed without an assertion can still be covered. Add success, failure, cancellation, and session isolation assertions from [Writing Tests](../writing-tests/); do not write empty tests simply to execute lines.

